6:["$","div",null,{"className":"prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-6","children":"While Ojas provides stability and grounding, Tejas provides fire, courage, and cutting intelligence. It is the refined energetic essence of the fire element (Agni) in the body. A person with high Tejas possesses a penetrating, sharp intellect, strong digestion, and a radiant, magnetic presence. They digest not only food efficiently, but also thoughts, experiences, and complex philosophical concepts. Too little Tejas results in dullness and lethargy; too much, unchecked by Ojas, leads to burnout, anger, and arrogant fanaticism."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"italic border-l-2 border-primary/20 pl-6 py-2","children":"A crucial concept in Ayurveda and Tantra. It explains why some yogis possess an intimidating, radiant power that commands attention. Tejas is the energetic fuel required to burn through deep-seated ignorance (Avidya)."}]]}]
